Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:07.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:18.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:23.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:27.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:34.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:41.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:49.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:55.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:59.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:03.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:10.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:21.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:01:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第52话 扼止不了的妖怪本性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:21.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有好多酒 头目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来这里倒酒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愈来愈衰弱了吧 半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:38.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自讨苦吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.48,0:02:41.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和人类一个鼻孔出气 就是这种下场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 结界…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气力已经到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也快点去陪我们头目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕吗 女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 这表情很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他果然是个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次陪头目的女人都会不见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正觉得奇怪的说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这卑劣的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.53,0:03:36.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒已经扩散到全身了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 临死前就在那里欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们一个个被吃掉的画面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:05.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有那把刀就能救大家了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:11.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你 用这把刀救救她们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这臭老头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？你还没睡醒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:28.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们通通完蛋啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:34.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 竟然敢做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这老糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:02.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个…拿给那位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里？他在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:15.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人好像蛮可口的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:17.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她抓过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:18.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 结界已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是头目的命令 快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不让你们碰戈薇一根汗毛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:53.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们逃不掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 数量太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:56.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界…已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:04.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 撑着点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:35.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然打破了我的毒茧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:06:59.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的脸…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖化了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.53,0:07:25.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 别笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,区区半妖也想打赢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妖怪 蛾天丸大爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:06.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是妖怪之血的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,融化了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底不过是个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.85,0:08:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:45.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:54.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您又出去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:09:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 您在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:06.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要把臣丢下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是因为和小铃 在一起的关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种人类女孩 随便哪里一丢就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:25.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的为了确认朴仙翁说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑到犬夜叉那里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然说来话长 又不知道该不该说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀生丸少爷不同血脉的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是妖怪的层级 或是气度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都无法相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 其实
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀？怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等…你要上哪去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为好像要说很久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.65,0:10:05.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 阿 哞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边有好吃的草喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿 哞？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未免太刻薄了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想跑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 保护这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:23.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是听从头目的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饶了我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点住手 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经在求饶了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:35.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连戈薇的声音也听不进去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.82,0:11:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:46.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在要杀人的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快把铁碎牙 交给犬夜叉然后镇住他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想看到犬夜叉那样的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！快拿铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变回原来的样子 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:18.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会战斗的怪物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:40.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是犬夜叉从你父亲身上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.31,0:12:42.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继承的大妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对半妖的身体而言太强烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且在不断反覆妖化中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一日犬夜叉 会完全丧失理智
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管来吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖化之后的你到底有多强
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:08.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:27.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸的斗鬼神
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单单是剑压就能撕裂敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在碰到它之前就会被打倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然将剑拨开了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白费力气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经浑身是伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再打了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你连恐惧也…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连疼痛都感受不到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:24.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被妖怪之血吞噬理智了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,持续战斗直到身体毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了确认朴仙翁说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:38.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才特地跟着你而来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可怜 我终于明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的你不是完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追根究底 不过是只半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:55.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你知道自己有几两重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.55,0:15:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 半妖就该像个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地上爬吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:24.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.08,0:15:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:41.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.11,0:15:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托不要再打了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于动弹不得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.37,0:16:07.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也会遭殃的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让他住手的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用铁碎牙解除他的妖化吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则等他醒过来 又要反抗了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是打算杀他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你可以一刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将犬夜叉劈成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你只用剑压击退他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.18,0:16:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该很恨犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:48.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为你是 突然动了兄弟之情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:50.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我迟早会杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:51.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:55.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都不知道的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:56.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有杀的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像是 来阻止犬夜叉失控一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 您回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲 有没有好好听话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玲和阿跟哞很用心的看家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.23,0:17:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是邪见爷爷好像很消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.11,0:17:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您为何要独自跑去找犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:18:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉 恕我多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你还不能动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:22.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是我做的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的爪子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:35.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沾满了强盗们的血腥味
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:38.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.33,0:18:42.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是为了救那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这个原因才动手的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:18:58.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠近他会被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:19.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是怪物又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大哥哥救了爷爷的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把坏人通通打跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:34.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在狩猎人类而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:36.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想变成的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这个样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这次妖化之后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎连自己是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连戈薇说的话也…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:56.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:20:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使犬夜叉变成完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是想和他一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:03.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为了琥珀给大家添了麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.91,0:20:10.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家依然还是 理所当然一般和我在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.55,0:20:12.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 血腥味消不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用勉强陪我没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从刚才大家就对我提心吊胆的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是没办法 不在意自己做过的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.77,0:21:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…我能了解的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在妖化那段时间的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前从没这样过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再妖化的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.69,0:21:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的爪子…戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.53,0:22:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定会连你都撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:30.55,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:42.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:49.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.57,0:22:53.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:57.68,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:23:04.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:12.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:19.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:27.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.98,0:23:35.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.67,0:23:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉无法抑制 失控的妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他不想变成 只知道战斗的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:56.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在某处应该有解决的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:23:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果打倒龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙就会变轻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:03.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接受刀刀斋的试炼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.69,0:24:05.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踏上旅程的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.69,0:24:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落又再度布下了陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.89,0:24:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲的宿敌龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:14.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
